{
  "info": {
    "name": "Central Archive - 03 Projects & Files",
    "_postman_id": "projects-files-collection-0003",
    "description": "Projects, Project Members, and File management endpoints.\n\nBase URL: {{baseUrl}} (default http://localhost:8080)\n\n## First step\nRun **Setup > Login** once. It stores the token into `{{token}}` automatically. Bearer auth is configured at collection level.\n\n## File upload\nFile upload uses multipart/form-data: the file is sent as the `file` (single) or `files` (batch) field, and metadata (a `FileUploadRequest` JSON object) is sent as the `metadata` RequestPart field.\n\n## Project lifecycle\nDRAFT -> submit-for-review (UNDER_REVIEW) -> approve (APPROVED), reject (REJECTED), or request-correction (NEEDS_CORRECTION). APPROVED projects may then be archived (ARCHIVED).\n\n## Auto-captured IDs\nAfter **Create Project** / **Add Member** / **Upload File**, the ids are stored into `{{projectId}}`, `{{memberId}}`, `{{fileId}}` respectively.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
